                                "text": "Ferguson could never let go of his mother, his unsmothering mother whose love was the source of all life for him, and merely to see her frown at him with that sad look in her eyes was a devastation, a bullet in the heart."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3607f3b9-27da-4d33-9928-d0fb366344f6",
                                "sense_id": "44a3605d-1b6c-33f7-951f-f06a670a347d",
                                "text": "You are the very model of unsmothering motherhood."
